   {step===3&&<div className="setup-page"><p className="setup-eyebrow">{osMode!=='ios27'?'STEP 3 OF 7 · DESKTOP':'STEP 3 OF 7 · PERSONALIZATION'}</p><h1 id="setup-title">{osMode!=='ios27'?'Choose desktop appearance.':'Set your desktop style.'}</h1><p className="setup-lead">Select a theme, accent color and wallpaper. You can change them anytime in Settings.</p><div className="setup-theme-options">{(['dark','light','system'] as const).map(value=><button key={value} className={'setup-theme-option '+(theme===value?'selected':'')} onClick={()=>setTheme(value)}><span className={'setup-theme-sample '+value}><i/><i/><i/></span><b>{value==='dark'?'Dark':value==='light'?'Light':'Use device setting'}</b><small>{theme===value?'Selected':'Choose theme'}</small></button>)}</div><label className="setup-field setup-accent-field">Accent color<input type="color" value={accent} onChange={e=>setAccent(e.target.value)} /><span>{accent.toUpperCase()}</span></label><div className="setup-wallpaper-title"><b>Wallpaper</b><small>Choose a desktop background</small></div><div className="setup-wallpaper-grid">{wallpapers.map(([id,label])=><button key={id} className={'setup-wallpaper-option wallpaper-'+id+(wallpaper===id?' selected':'')} onClick={()=>setWallpaper(id)} aria-pressed={wallpaper===id}><span/><b>{label}</b></button>)}</div></div>}
   {step===4&&<div className="setup-page"><p className="setup-eyebrow">{osMode!=='ios27'?'STEP 4 OF 7 · SOUND & ACCESSIBILITY':'STEP 4 OF 7 · ACCESSIBILITY & SOUND'}</p><h1 id="setup-title">{osMode!=='ios27'?'Configure sound and accessibility.':'Make the interface comfortable.'}</h1><p className="setup-lead">Set the starting volume and choose the amount of motion that feels right.</p><section className="setup-sound-card"><div className="setup-option-heading"><span className="setup-option-icon"><Volume2 size={18}/></span><div><b>System media volume</b><small>Used by AeroShell audio players and previews</small></div><strong>{volume}%</strong></div><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value={volume} onChange={e=>setVolume(Number(e.target.value))} aria-label="Setup volume"/><div className="setup-range-ends"><small>Muted</small><small>Maximum</small></div><div className="setup-volume-warning">Your browser or device volume can still affect the final loudness.</div></section><label className="setup-toggle"><span><strong>Reduce motion</strong><small>Use fewer moving backgrounds and transitions.</small></span><input type="checkbox" checked={reduceMotion} onChange={e=>setReduceMotion(e.target.checked)}/></label><div className="setup-info-card"><ShieldCheck size={18}/><p>These are AeroShell preferences, not changes to your phone, Chromebook or computer system settings.</p></div></div>}
   {step===5&&<div className="setup-page"><p className="setup-eyebrow">STEP 5 OF 7 · PRIVACY</p><h1 id="setup-title">Know where your data lives.</h1><p className="setup-lead">AeroShell is local-first, with no account required.</p><div className="setup-privacy-card"><div className="setup-privacy-icon"><ShieldCheck size={23}/></div><div><strong>Your files and settings stay in this browser</strong><p>Notes, events, desktop preferences, text files and app lists are saved locally. Uploaded photos and audio are saved in browser IndexedDB. Nothing here is sent to a server by this setup process. Clearing site data may remove local files.</p></div></div><div className="setup-privacy-checks"><span><Check size={15}/> No login or email</span><span><Check size={15}/> No system files modified</span><span><Check size={15}/> No background device scan</span></div></div>}
